        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> VIDEO EDITOR · CINEMATOGRAPHER · STORYTELLER</p>
        <h1>I shape moments<br>into <em>meaningful stories.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-intro">I am Esther Idim Nehemiah — a media professional drawn to the power of visual storytelling. I turn ideas, footage and real moments into thoughtful visual experiences.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-gold" href="#work">Explore my work <span>↘</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="mailto:idimesther@gmail.com">Let’s create together ↗</a>
        </div>
