    <section class="intro-section section-wrap" id="about">
      <div class="section-index">01 / ABOUT</div>
      <div class="intro-content">
        <p class="eyebrow">A CREATIVE MIND. A STORY-FIRST APPROACH.</p>
        <h2>Every frame has a purpose.<br><em>Every story deserves care.</em></h2>
        <div class="intro-columns">
          <p>I am a highly creative, results-oriented media professional with a background in Mass Communication and Performing Arts. My work spans video editing, cinematography, production support and post-production.</p>
          <p>From assembling a story and shaping its rhythm to managing footage and refining the final picture, I approach each project with attention to detail, collaboration and a commitment to the message behind the visuals.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="underlined-link" href="assets/Esther-Idim-CV.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download my CV <span>↗</span></a>
